        "summary":  "Microsoft unveiled Project Perception, an agentic security platform that deploys three classes of AI agents ΓÇö red team (attack simulation), blue team (threat detection), and green team (remediation) ΓÇö forming a continuously learning cyber-defense system. The platform\u0027s MAI-Cyber-1-Flash model achieves 96% on the CyberGym benchmark with significant cost savings. Project Perception entered public preview on August 3, 2026.",
        "execSummary":  "Enterprise security leaders should take note: Microsoft is operationalizing AI agents not just for productivity but for autonomous, machine-speed cyber defense. Project Perception\u0027s three-agent architecture ΓÇö attack, detect, remediate ΓÇö represents a structural shift from human-in-the-loop SOC operations toward AI-orchestrated defense loops. For enterprises scaling AI infrastructure, this signals that the security perimeter must itself become agentic to keep pace with AI-enabled attackers. The caveat: autonomous remediation agents introduce new failure modes and accountability gaps that governance teams have not yet addressed at scale.",
