        "execSummary":  "This partnership is a template for how hyperscalers are packaging enterprise AI adoption: infrastructure modernization and business-process AI come bundled together, deepening platform lock-in on both sides. For customer-support and operations leaders, the 3M case study is directly relevant ΓÇö AI agent workflows handling order management and credit assessment represent the next tier of automation beyond simple chatbots. The key implication is that AI transformation at enterprise scale now requires coordinated commitment across IT infrastructure, finance, and operations ΓÇö not just a line-of-business pilot. Enterprises should audit which vendor relationships are evolving into multi-layer dependencies and negotiate governance terms accordingly.",
