        "summary":  "CIOs are facing rapidly escalating AI expenditures as deployments multiply across business units without centralized oversight or cost controls. Vendors including Oracle and AWS have introduced new cost visibility features to help enterprises track AI spending, while the Linux Foundation launched a Tokenomics Foundation to help organizations model AI economics more systematically. The article highlights the tension between enabling AI innovation at speed and maintaining financial discipline.",
