        "date":  "2026-07-21",
        "theme":  "Agents",
        "summary":  "A Unisys survey of 1,000 IT and business decision-makers found that over 80% of leaders expect AI agents to help manage growing cloud application portfolios, yet only 23% have deployed agentic AI at scale. Security concerns and governance gaps are the leading barriers to broader deployment, with 93% of respondents citing cloud security as a key factor in how much autonomy they grant AI systems. The data suggests agentic AI for IT operations is in wide pilot but not yet in production at enterprise scale.",
